      "text": "[6:18PM] #Maryland_Ikeja #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic is flowing smoothly along the service lane, with a seamless journey from Anthony inward to Maryland intersection, onwards to Odo'yalaro and Mobolaji Bank Anthony Way, where the entire stretch is calm. \n\nAdditionally, traffic conditions are favorable along Kodesoh Road, Oba Akran Road and Local Airport Road, Oba Akinjobi Way, and Ikeja G.R.A.\n\nOur officers are effectively managing traffic at their respective locations, ensuring a smooth flow, and the area is currently free of impediments. \n\n#FollowLASTMA",
