      "text": "[6:36PM] #Marina #TrafficUpdate \n\nInner Marina Road is good movement from UBA Roundabout to NNPC Filling Station, and from Cathedral Church to Nitel Intersection.\nState House to McWen Bridge is good movement connecting Force Road.\nZone 2 Underpass to Victoria Island is perfect movement from Flagstaff House to McWen Bridge.\nOnikan Roundabout to Nitel Intersection is good movement via TBS and Water Board.\nBroad Street, Igbosere Road, and Catholic Mission Street is good movement, including connections to Ganiu Smith Street.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
